flowchart TD
    Start[Traffic increases] --> Measure[Measure lane saturation and queue length]
    Measure --> Surge{Threshold crossed?}
    Surge -- No --> Normal[Normal telemetry and registration]
    Surge -- Yes --> CPR[Crowd Pressure Router ranks lanes]
    CPR --> Capacity{Lane headroom?}
    Capacity -- Yes --> Lock[Allocate under row lock]
    Capacity -- No --> Queue[Join shortest locked queue]
    Measure --> Lite[Set Lite Mode when surge is detected]
